(2 < 9) iqiniso: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['Yes, nine is less than ten.']. }.
(9 < 2) iqiniso: { Okuphumayo bhala: ['My logic fails']. }.
Okuphumayo bhala: (-2 + 6).
Okuphumayo bhala: (-3 - -3).
>> TrueIsNice := 3.
Okuphumayo bhala: TrueIsNice.
>> FalseIsBad := ['Not true!'].
Okuphumayo bhala: FalseIsBad.
>> NilIsEmpty := ['Yep'].
Okuphumayo bhala: NilIsEmpty.
